==Battleground==
*2 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] (400%) spawn, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[B.B.Bunny]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Dagshund]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**1 [[Moe Uzumasa & Doge]] spawns.
**1 [[Misa Ono & Doge]] spawns.

==Strategy==
If you can take out each Dagshund before the next spawns, you shouldn't have much trouble with this stage. To accomplish that task, bring cats with high attack power such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] or [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]]. Alternatively, [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] can deal huge nuke damage to all of the enemies, making the stage quite easy.

